The mobile menu clips because `.mega` is `position:static` inside a fixed `site-nav` with `overflow-y:auto` — the mega panel doesn't fill the available height, so content gets clipped. Fix: make `.mega` fill the viewport below the header on mobile, and let `.mega-inner` scroll.
